              "id": "glog-34f02e5d-3c72-4bd4-b6bd-d34bb8368725",
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "```markdown\n### Description\nCVE-2019-2816 is a vulnerability found in the Java SE component of Oracle Java SE (subcomponent: Java SE, Java SE Embedded, JRockit). It affects versions prior to 7u221, 8u212, 11.0.3, and 12.0.1. The vulnerability is related to the Java SE Libraries and can be exploited by an unauthenticated attacker with network access via multiple protocols. Successful exploitation of this vulnerability can result in unauthorized read access to a subset of Java SE data.\n\n### General Mitigation Advice\n1. **Update Java SE**: Ensure that you are using the latest version of Java SE. Oracle has released patches for this vulnerability, so updating to a version that is 7u221, 8u212, 11.0.3, 12.0.1, or later will mitigate the risk.\n2. **Network Security**: Restrict network access to the Java application to trusted users and networks only. Use firewalls and network segmentation to limit exposure.\n3. **Input Validation**: Implement strict input validation to prevent malicious data from being processed by the application.\n4. **Security Best Practices**: Follow Java security best practices, such as running with the least privileges necessary and using security managers where applicable.\n\n### Source Code Fix Recommendation\nWhile the specific source code fix for this vulnerability is not publicly detailed, general recommendations include:\n\n- **Review and Update Libraries**: Ensure that all third-party libraries and dependencies are up-to-date and free from known vulnerabilities.\n- **Code Review**: Conduct a thorough code review to identify and fix any potential security issues related to data handling and access control.\n\n### Relevant OWASP Resources\n- [OWASP Top Ten](https://owasp.org/www-project-top-ten/)\n\n### Common Weakness Enumeration (CWE)\n- [CWE-200: Exposure of Sensitive Information to an Unauthorized Actor](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/200.html)\n```"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "CVE-2019-2816/suse:java:"
                ]
              }
